********************************************************************
* Prerequisites for building SIW userlib
********************************************************************
1) GCC version 7 or later
2) libsysfs devel package
3) cmake
4) libnl3 devel package
5) rdma-core build folder

********************************************************************
* rdma-core build folder
********************************************************************
> git clone https://github.com/linux-rdma/rdma-core
> cd rdma-core
> git checkout <rdma_core_ver e.g. v22.4>
> ./build.sh

********************************************************************
* Instructions for building SIW userlib
********************************************************************
> ./autogen.sh
> ./configure --with-rdma-core=<rdma_core_dir> --sysconfdir=/etc --libdir=/usr/lib64/libibverbs
> make
> sudo make install

********************************************************************
* Notes
********************************************************************
- librdmacm must be used for bringing up connection (ie ib_send_bw needs -R param)
- Same iface cannot also have RoCE support or the rdmacm will use RoCE instead 
	(rmmod mlx5_ib to use mlx5 ifaces for SIW)

